  "description": "Welcome to the East Midlands! Experience express, and local passenger duties between a trifecta of scenic English counties. Swoosh through the countryside and sprint to the finish aboard renowned traction. The locals of Leicester, Derby and Nottingham await in Train Sim World®: Midland Main Line!\n\nClimb aboard the regional staple of the UK, the BR Class 158 Sprinter. This 1990s-born DMU has served as the backbone of the nation, running everywhere from Wick to Penzance, and beyond with export models also reaching Thailand! Shuttle through the East Midlands on local services, sporting the iconic East Midlands Trains livery, calling at every station, taking in the local sights and rumbling by on Cummins prime mover technology.\n\nFrom a rumble to a roar, race through the towns in the legendary HST. Also wearing the colourful swooshes of EMT, the HST – complete in Midland Main Line condition (different lights, cab and interior) – is a world-renowned icon, which for over 40 years was the flagship of UK Intercity travel. Rekindle the now lost time of VP185 traction and get up to speed on EMT’s long distance expresses."
